  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">04 Enhance the resilience of vuln. SHF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country portfolio budget - CPB Sierra Leone 2026-2030 Provide a context-specific package of interventions to enhance the resilience of vulnerable smallholder farmers and value-chain actors to climate and economic shocks, support local capacities, and foster partnerships to sustainably increase access to nutrient-dense foods.</narrative>
  </description>
